<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan Stanley starts Petro-Canada.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan Stanley starts Petro-Canada.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said Tuesday it initiated coverage of Petro-Canada as neutral.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley also said it initiated coverage of Suncor Inc as outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
